ection_url }}" class="m-cat"><span class="m-eyebrow">02 / MADE FOR JOY ↗</span><span class="m-cat-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◒</span><h3>Little daily rituals</h3></a><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="m-cat"><span class="m-eyebrow">03 / THE GOOD STUFF ↗</span><span class="m-cat-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✿</span><h3>Feel-good favorites</h3></a></div></div></section><section class="m-story"><div class="m-story-visual"><div class="m-story-art"></div></div><div class="m-story-content"><span class="m-eyebrow">03 / THE MORUVA WAY</span><h2>Life looks<br>better in<br><em style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400">colour.</em></h2><p class="m-bodycopy">We believe everyday spaces should spark a little joy. The things we live with can make ordinary moments feel extraordinary.</p><a class="m-button" href="/pages/about">GET TO KNOW US ↗</a></div></section><section class="m-section"><div class="m-container" style="text-align:center"><span class="m-eyebrow">✳ SMALL THINGS. BRIGHT DAYS. ✳</span><h2 style="font-size:clamp(48px,8vw,120px);letter-spacing:-.09em;line-height:1;max-width:1100px;margin:30px auto">Your everyday,<br><em style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400">but more you.</em></h2><a class="m-button" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">SHOP THE COLLECTION ↗</a></div></section></div>{% schema %}{"name":"Moruva home","settings":[{"type":"collection","id":"collection","label":"Featured collection"}],"presets":[{"name":"Moruva home"}]}{% endschema %}